#. ja: ドワーフパンチ……？<br>これがヒトが飲む「オサケ」なのね……。
#. de: „Zwergenpunsch“? Ulkiger Name für ein ulkiges Getränk, hihi!
#. fr: Un “bourre-pif nain”<nbsp>? C'est ça que boivent les humains<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_095:1"
msgid "“Dwarven Decking”? As in a sort of punch? I learned that one from the children, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ちゅるっと、一口…………。
#. de: Na gut, dann probiere ich mal!
#. fr: Allez, je goûte<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_096:1"
msgid "Let's take a sip..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふはぁっ♪
#. de: \<gluck> \<gluck>
#. fr: Fouah<nbsp>!♪
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_100_096:1"
msgid "Oh my!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: うへー、なにこの泥みたいな味……。<br>ヒトっていうのは、こんなモノをありがたがってるの？<br>んー、エゼルII世なら好きそうな味だけどさ……。
#. de: \<prust> Igitt, was ist das denn?! Gremlinrotze, gemischt mit Fuathschweiß? Bääh!
#. fr: Beurk<nbsp>! On dirait de la boue<nbsp>! Tu es en train de me dire que les humains aiment ce truc<nbsp>? C'est une boisson pour Ezel II, ça, pas pour les Pixies<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_097:1"
msgid "Blech! I don't know how you mortals can drink this filth! Perhaps Ezel would like it, though. After all, it feeds on nightmares, and this is a nightmare in liquid form."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 子どもたちには、たとえ夢の中であっても、<br>こんな不味い泥水を、飲ませるわけにはいかないわ！<br>じゃあね、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>！
#. de: Mit so einer Plörre haben wir Pixies ganz sicher keinen Spaß, da bekommt man ja Albträume! Das ist nix für mich. Mach's gut, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Même si c'est dans un rêve, je ferai jamais boire ça aux enfants<nbsp>! À bientôt, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_098:1"
msgid "I do hope for your sakes that not all alcohol tastes as vile as this nasty concoction. Should I ever pluck up the courage to come back, I trust you'll have something more palatable for me next time!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: フラッド・オブ・ライト……？<br>これがヒトが飲む「オサケ」なのね……。
#. de: „Lichtfluter“? Das ist so eines dieser lustigen Getränke, richtig?
#. fr: Un “déluge de Lumière”<nbsp>? C'est ça que boivent les humains<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_100:1"
msgid "“Wicked White”? That's what you mortals say when you stub your toes, isn't it? Of course, we pixies never have that problem. Anyway, let's give it a taste..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ちゅるっと、一口…………。
#. de: Na gut, dann probiere ich mal!
#. fr: Allez, je goûte<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_101:1"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふはぁっ♪
#. de: \<gluck> \<gluck> \<gluck>
#. fr: Fouah<nbsp>!♪
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_100_101:1"
msgid "I say, that's wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ん～、なかなかイケるじゃない！<br>甘味の中に、ちょっぴり苦味があって、<br>エケボアの尾を吸ったときに、少し似てるかも……！
#. de: Hmm! Gar nicht schlecht! Süß, aber auch etwas sauer. Schmeckt so ähnlich wie Echevoren-Schweife.
#. fr: Hum... C'est pas mal du tout<nbsp>! C'est sucré et amer à la fois, on dirait un peu le goût de la queue d'échevore...
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_102:1"
msgid "Why, it's as sweet as an echevore's tail!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふひっ……でも、なんだか、頭の中がフワフワして……<br>楽しい夢が、作れそうな気分になってきたよぉ。<br>それひゃあ、またぬぇ～♪
#. de: Hui ... Irgendwie wird mir nun aber ganz schwummerig im Kopf. Da bekommt man richtig Lust, schöne Träume zu weben! Ich bin dann mal wieder weg, mach's gut, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Mais... C'est bizarre... J'ai la tête qui tourne... J'ai l'impression que je vais pouvoir fabriquer plein de rêves rigolos, comme ça, hi hi<nbsp>! À bientôt, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_103:1"
msgid "I could drink this all day! In fact, maybe I─ Oh, hold on. I feel a bit funny. Like I'm floating in the air... Wait, I am floating, aren't I? I'm so confused."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ガウガウ……ドリーム……。<br>なんだか、恐ろしい夢を見ちゃいそうな名前ね。
#. de: „Biba Colada“? D-Dieser Name klingt ja wie ein schlechter Traum!
#. fr: “Graou-graou utopique”... Euh... Ça fait peur comme nom, ça, non<nbsp>? Je vais pas faire des cauchemars si je bois ça, hein<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_105:1"
msgid "“Alcoholic Beaverage”!? No, anything but beavers! Oh, it's just the name?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ちゅるっと、一口…………。
#. de: Ich nehme mal vorsichtig einen Schluck ... \<nipp>
#. fr: Allez, je goûte...
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_106:1"
msgid "Perhaps I could try a sip, then."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-謎めいた鳴き声-)ガウガウ、ガウガガウガウ……。
#. de: ♪ \<schlürf> \<schlürf> \<flöt> \<quietsch> \<knabber> ♪
#. fr: (-Cri étrange-)Graou<nbsp>! Graougraougraou<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_107:1"
msgid "(-Inexplicably Terrifying Squealing-)\\<squeal> \\<squeal>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あははは……！<br>ねぇ、ねぇ、びっくりした？
#. de: Hihi! Na? Habt ihr euch erschrocken?
#. fr: Ah ah ah<nbsp>! Tu as eu peur, hein, avoue<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_108:1"
msgid "Hahaha! You should've seen the look on your face!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ガウガウドリームだなんて、<br>ピクシーが怖がるようなモノを、出すから悪いのよ？<br>イタズラの夢を見せる術なら、私の方が上手なんだから！
#. de: „Biba Colada“, hm? Damit wollt ihr uns Pixies wohl einen Schrecken einjagen, was? Aber wenn es um traumhaften Schabernack geht, macht mir so schnell keiner etwas vor, hihi!
#. fr: C'est ta faute pour m'avoir donné quelque chose qui fait peur aux Pixies<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_109:1"
msgid "I'm sorry, I didn't mean to scare you. It just goes to show, there's nothing more frightening than a beaver, even if it's only me using my powers to trick you!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: はー、面白かった♪<br>ありがとね、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>！
#. de: Hat Spaß gemacht! Danke und mach's gut, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Aaah... C'était vraiment amusant<nbsp>! Merci, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_TYRBEQ_000_110:1"
msgid "Well, that was fun. For me, at least. Thanks for the drink, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: なかなかのバーテンダーぶりだったな。<br>オレ様も楽しませてもらったぜ。<br>ありがとよ！
#. de: Du bist ja ein Naturtalent hinterm Tresen! Ich bin beeindruckt!
#. fr: Tu t'es bien débrouillé<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>! Merci pour ton aide, aujourd'hui<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_GIRUTT_000_115:1"
msgid "You seemed to have mastered the mixin' part, but that's only the beginnin'. Now you'll have to work on improvin' your banter. You can't let the customer do all the talkin' while you smile and nod!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、客の相手をしたくなったら、<br>いつでも気軽に声をかけてくれよな！
#. de: Falls du mal wieder die Gäste begrüßen willst, kannst du gerne jederzeit wiederkommen!
#. fr: Hésite pas à revenir me voir quand tu auras envie de taquiner du cocktail<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_GIRUTT_000_116:1"
msgid "Since you did such a good job, I won't charge you for today's lesson on how to be the perfect bartender. Keep this up, and I might even have to pay you one of these days! Just jokin', you're still a novice."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そうか、興が乗らないんじゃ仕方ねぇな。<br>またいつでも、声をかけてくれよな！
#. de: Verstehe, ist wohl nicht ganz dein Ding, wie? Falls du es dir irgendwann anders überlegen solltest, findest du mich hier.
#. fr: Bah, tant pis, j'peux pas te forcer de toute façon<nbsp>! Hésite pas à venir me voir si t'as envie de t'essayer à la fabrication de cocktail un jour<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Girutt_00688:TEXT_REGNOR4GIRUTT_00688_GIRUTT_000_120:1"
msgid "If you're not here to work or to buy a drink, you can bugger off. If you decide to stop wastin' my time, though, my door is always open. Well, my proverbial door, that is."
msgstr ""
